                        <div class="product-specs">Emas 18K White Gold | GIA Certified D-F Color</div>
                        <a href="https://wa.me/628123456789" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Konsultasi VIP</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Product 2: Kalung Tennis -->
                <div class="product-card">
                    <div class="product-image">
                        <span class="product-tag">Classic Luxury</span>
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611591475281-8d2823228e8f?q=80&w=600" alt="Lumiera Allure Tennis Necklace">
                    </div>
                    <div class="product-details">
                        <h3 class="product-title">Allure Tennis Necklace</h3>
                        <p class="product-desc">Barisan berlian presisi mengelilingi leher secara simetris sempurna untuk tampilan mewah dan berkelas pada acara istimewa.</p>
                        <div class="product-specs">Emas 18K Platinum / Rose Gold | VVS Clarity</div>
                        <a href="https://wa.me/628123456789" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Konsultasi VIP</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Product 3: Gelang Bangle -->
                <div class="product-card">
                    <div class="product-image">
                        <span class="product-tag">Bestseller</span>
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605100804763-247f67b3557e?q=80&w=600" alt="Lumiera Royale Eternity Bangle">
                    </div>
                    <div class="product-details">
                        <h3 class="product-title">Royale Eternity Bangle</h3>
                        <p class="product-desc">Gelang kaku (*bangle*) dengan jajaran berlian *pave setting* yang memberikan kesan tegas, modern, dan anggun.</p>
                        <div class="product-specs">Emas 18K | Double-Lock Safety Clasp</div>
                        <a href="https://wa.me/628123456789" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Konsultasi VIP</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Product 4: Gelang Tennis -->
                <div class="product-card">
                    <div class="product-image">
                        <span class="product-tag">Timeless</span>
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1535632066927-ab7c9ab60908?q=80&w=600" alt="Lumiera Grace Tennis Bracelet">
                    </div>
                    <div class="product-details">
                        <h3 class="product-title">Grace Tennis Bracelet</h3>
